    "description": "terminal2/pp built from lumped constitutive submodules (modules/haemodynamics/lumped_constitutive): I_p (inertance pp_linear) -> R_p (resistance vp_linear) -> C (compliance vv_linear) -> R_d (resistance pv_linear) -> I_d (inertance pp_linear); V (vessel_volume summed) gathers the compliances' volumes. Reproduces the monolithic version (supermodule.equivalent_version in its spec).",
